description:
Rework topic and wiki concept pages to the concept-page artboard (https://claude.ai/artifact/EoXGtpzsayij4d7tmrfZ9r):
- the definition, with an Edited by AI or Approved by stamp;
- the lineage line;
- the 8-week trend, with the real span;
- the neighbourhood;
- sub-concepts;
- the clusters it touches;
- latest signals;
- stories that cite it.

Open proposals ship as a placeholder until Reposition 3.

Acceptance: `/topics/decision-models/` and a wiki concept page match the artboard in light and dark.
